  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66390703af7ed7c0ff2e04a5cd39f4ef833cb3c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2c73ad4a756ee6090ce75d169328e9da83ce8b6d.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n此資源包無法在純淨Minecraft中使用。你需要安裝Hold My Items模組\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hold-my-items\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dbfb3032a0b4d78e24701cc19f557afe6dba5b17.png\" width=\"280\" alt=\"圖片1\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62f097d3725f173dfbddb5c261ddc8b1fcd5e6b2.png\" width=\"280\" alt=\"圖片2\">\n  </a>\n\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66390703af7ed7c0ff2e04a5cd39f4ef833cb3c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n![介紹](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c23a25019880c315acc125ca53855d1ee9f30631.png)\n---\n此資源包將大多數預設Minecraft物品轉換為獨特且精緻的3D模型，為遊戲帶來煥然一新且身臨其境的視覺體驗。靈感來自Oreville Studios的Action & Stuff\n\n感謝arch1vways提供核心著色器。\n\n所有圖片皆使用Beash的Atmospherics模組拍攝",
